,{"type":"Domain","start":96,"end":287,"description":"Guanylate kinase-like"},{"type":"Binding site","start":103,"end":110,"description":"ATP"},{"type":"Domain","start":300,"end":333,"description":"WW 1"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":357,"end":357,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Domain","start":359,"end":392,"description":"WW 2"},{"type":"Domain","start":472,"end":554,"description":"PDZ 2"},{"type":"Domain","start":643,"end":721,"description":"PDZ 3"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":730,"end":730,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":741,"end":741,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":800,"end":800,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Domain","start":813,"end":895,"description":"PDZ 4"},{"type":"Domain","start":970,"end":1066,"description":"PDZ 5"},{"type":"Region","start":970,"end":1066,"description":"Interaction with FCHSD2"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":1071,"end":1071,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Domain","start":1124,"end":1206,"description":"PDZ 6"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":1361,"end":1361,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":1412,"end":1412,"description":"Phosphoserine"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Part of a complex composed of AMOTL2, MAGI1 and CDH5, within the complex AMOTL2 acts as a scaffold protein for the interaction of MAGI1 with CDH5 (By similarity). The complex is required for coupling actin fibers to cell junctions in endothelial cells (By similarity). Interacts through its WW 2 domain with SYNPO and through its PDZ 5 domain with ACTN4 (PubMed:12042308). Interacts with cytoplasmic domain of ADGRB1 (PubMed:9647739). Interacts via its WW domains with DRPLA (PubMed:9647693). Interacts with ESAM, LRP2 and CXADR (By similarity). May interact with CTNNB1 (By similarity). Interacts through its PDZ 1 domain with NET1 (By similarity). Interacts with ASIC3 and AMOT (PubMed:15317815, PubMed:16043488). Interacts with FCHSD2 (PubMed:14627983). Interacts with IGSF5/JAM4 and through its PDZ 2 and 3 domains with NPHS1 forming a tripartite complex (By similarity) (PubMed:12773569). Interacts with DDN (PubMed:16751601). Interacts with DLL1 (By similarity). Interacts with KCNJ10 and possibly with KCNJ10/KCNJ16 heterodimer; this interaction may facilitate KCNJ10/KCNJ16 potassium channel expression at the basolateral membrane in kidney tubular cells. Interacts with PRRG4 (via cytoplasmic domain) (PubMed:23873930)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q96QZ7-2","name":"2","synonyms":["MAGI-1C-beta"],"notes":[],"length":1462,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000402939.7"],"refseq":["NM_001033057.2"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001028229.1"],"maneSelect":true,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,805],[807,835,192],[999,1028,464]],"edits":[{"start":806,"end":834,"original":"PMSPSPASGLSKGEREREINSTNFGECPI","replacement":"L","added":1},{"start":1027,"end":1027,"original":"A","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":30,"replaced":0,"novel":1,"foldedAbsent":0,"foldedMissing":0,"features":[[11,22,0],[12,1,0],[13,1,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q96QZ7-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q96QZ7-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":60.8,"plddt":[[0,6],[50,3],[70,1],[90,2],[70,2],[90,3],[70,13],[90,15],[70,3],[50,1],[0,11],[50,2],[70,3],[90,9],[70,1],[90,15],[70,7],[90,6],[70,4],[90,9],[70,7],[90,15],[70,1],[90,11],[70,2],[90,1],[70,1],[90,1],[70,3],[90,15],[70,1],[90,7],[70,3],[90,8],[70,4],[50,10],[70,1],[50,2],[0,88],[50,3],[70,5],[90,1],[70,1],[90,1],[70,3],[50,1],[70,4],[90,2],[70,15],[50,2],[0,5],[50,3],[0,14],[50,3],[70,2],[50,1],[70,3],[90,1],[70,4],[50,1],[70,3],[90,2],[70,27],[50,10],[0,19],[50,1],[0,23],[50,1],[70,10],[90,10],[70,2],[90,6],[70,8],[90,4],[70,2],[90,1],[70,4],[90,2],[70,1],[90,5],[70,3],[90,7],[70,2],[90,3],[70,2],[90,1],[70,2],[90,11],[70,1],[90,9],[70,4],[50,3],[0,77],[50,1],[70,3],[90,6],[70,4],[90,1],[70,1],[90,3],[70,2],[50,6],[70,1],[90,4],[70,9],